  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Cook chopped potato in the boiling water over medium-high heat, until easily pierced with a knife, 8-10 minutes.\n• Drain potato and return to saucepan. Add the butter and milk. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc73dad232ff05cfc53068/step-4c524700.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is cooking, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken and savoury seasoning, until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc73dad232ff05cfc53068/step-e5f5c010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the plant-based crumbed chicken is cooking, roughly chop baby capsicum and tomato.\n• In a large bowl, combine tomato, baby capsicum, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc73dad232ff05cfc53068/step-cef50620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a medium microwave-safe bowl, add mushroom sauce and microwave for 30 seconds or until heated through.\n• Divide potato mash, seared plant-based crumbed chicken and baby capsicum salad between plates. Spoon mushroom sauce over chicken to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc73dad232ff05cfc53068/step-92916330.jpg"
    }
  ]
